    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "In an era of increasing urbanization, finding one’s dream environment (physical space and related services) might still be a frustrating process. Major issues that people face include: 1) Not sure what to look for, 2) Disorganized information and 3) Decision-making dilemmas. We propose SpaceBook, a mobile application that solves those major problems by several key features: 1) Checklist and related suggestions, 2) Listings organization and Multimedia Journaling, 3) Customizable and visualized decision-making, and 4) back-end that is supported by Big Data and machine learning. Through SpaceBook, we hope to empower space finders to make informed decisions when renting and buying real estate.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Zhang, Junwu; Zimmermann, Leandra; Alexandraki, Eleni; Doerpmund, Felix; Boss, Saniya; Hadzimujagic-Malits, Nadja; Raachini, Elie Matar El. (2020). SpaceBook - Find your space with confidence. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: https://purl.stanford.edu/xc503rz2123",
